# Netlify redirect rules for the Gopher prototype (Final/ deployed as site root).
# This file is Netlify-specific and is ignored by the GitHub Pages / TigerTech deploys.
#
# Serve the Gopher Deals pre-registration page at the bare domain so the link
# you send merchants can be just https://<your-site>.netlify.app/
# (200! = FORCED rewrite: index.html exists at "/", so without the ! Netlify
# serves the file and ignores this rule. /index.html still serves the homepage
# directly, so nav "Home" links keep working.)
/            /gopher-deals.html   200!

# Friendly short paths that also land on the pre-registration page.
# (/audience appears as a URL pill in the social carousel art — keep it resolving.)
/deals       /gopher-deals.html   200
/register    /gopher-deals.html   200
/audience    /gopher-deals.html   200

# Internal file mask: CLAUDE.md must live in Final/ for tooling, but should not
# be readable on the public site. Forced (301!) so the rule wins over the file.
/CLAUDE.md   /   301!
